cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "GroundTruth-Geo: A selected static evaluation set for address-specific US property questions"
message: "If you use this dataset or the accompanying grader / MCP server, please cite it as below and preserve its evidence boundary."
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Sullivan
    given-names: Tim
    website: "https://lastingground.com"
abstract: >-
  GroundTruth-Geo contains 33 selected static records across seven states
  and three address-specific property-question families. Each development
  export includes a structured reference answer, agency source label,
  agency entry-page URL, snapshot label, and content fingerprint. The
  repository ships a deterministic grader using SimpleQA F1 and the
  AA-Omniscience Index, plus a JSON-RPC stdio MCP server that exposes the
  bundled rows. This is not a representative or independently audited
  sample, evidence of nationwide accuracy, or proof that a source was
  rechecked today.
repository-code: "https://github.com/sulmusic2-star/groundtruth-geo"
url: "https://github.com/sulmusic2-star/groundtruth-geo"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - benchmark
  - factuality
  - large-language-models
  - model-context-protocol
  - mcp-server
  - llm-evaluation
  - geospatial
  - deterministic-verifier
references:
